    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef guess_odds(bits):\n    return f\"1 in {2 ** bits:,}\"\n\n\ndef average_tries(bits):\n    return 2 ** (bits - 1)\n\nfor bits in [8, 16, 28]:\n    print(f\"{bits}: {guess_odds(bits)}\")\n    print(f\"  average {average_tries(bits)}\")\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef guess_odds(bits):\n    return f\"1 in {2 ** bits:,}\"\n\n\ndef average_tries(bits):\n    return 2 ** (bits - 1)\n\nfor bits in [8, 16, 28]:\n    print(f\"{bits}: {guess_odds(bits)}\")\n    print(f\"  average {average_tries(bits)}\")\n```"
    }
